{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/reviewer-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:08:04.667331Z","id":"6f6769c295428e20f574f5bfa38b66816c0efb2f84847187b9e99311800af222","body":{"detail":"plugins/claude-code/scripts/ensure-qualifier.sh's header states 'A qualifier on PATH is never probed, used, or modified' and plugins/claude-code/README.md says the plugin 'never runs, replaces, or installs over a qualifier on your PATH, so the one you use in your shell can be any version' (implying it may be absent). The only place that tells a session to call the wrapper (`\"$WRAPPER\" exec <args>`) is plugins/claude-code/hooks/session-start's SessionStart additionalContext, which is injected once into the top-level session only. reviewing-into-qualifier/SKILL.md dispatches reviewer-prompt.md to a freshly spawned subagent for large-scope reviews ('dispatch one subagent per part with reviewer-prompt.md'); the brief is written as a self-contained handoff ('You are reviewing `{SCOPE}` in this repository') with no mention of the wrapper, so a subagent following it literally runs bare `qualifier threads <path>` (line 29) and `qualifier record --stdin ...` (lines 20-21), which fail with command-not-found in an environment where nothing has put qualifier on PATH.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":20},"end":{"line":29},"content_hash":"d08f984e643888c136d32cb3d7eacbae545b37543e847dff731b7fe24571ce6c"},"suggested_fix":"Have reviewing-into-qualifier/SKILL.md substitute the resolved binary path (or `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/ensure-qualifier.sh exec`) into the dispatched brief, or add an explicit line to reviewer-prompt.md telling the subagent to resolve qualifier via the plugin wrapper before any other qualifier command.","summary":"reviewer-prompt.md assumes bare `qualifier` is on PATH, which this plugin never guarantees","tags":["review","review:claude-plugin-pr14","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/verifier-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:08:04.667623Z","id":"2b7dd12789dadd56d0d791cf0f6d75ad62126aa2f9c53a2eb80a17dd7d7facce","body":{"detail":"Same gap as reviewer-prompt.md: plugins/claude-code/scripts/ensure-qualifier.sh never puts qualifier on PATH, and the wrapper-invocation instruction is only injected into the top-level session via plugins/claude-code/hooks/session-start's SessionStart hook. reviewing-into-qualifier/SKILL.md says to 'always dispatch a fresh verifier subagent with verifier-prompt.md,' and the brief is self-contained ('You are verifying these qualifier findings: `{IDS}`') with no inherited context, so it never sees the wrapper instruction. Its bare commands (`qualifier threads <id> --format json` at line 4, `qualifier record --stdin ...` at lines 14-15) fail with command-not-found in the plugin's default configuration.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":15},"content_hash":"36ea6d4446e1906bc543641fc790e2a67af0052ab4010219eb92a5348c2d4a40"},"suggested_fix":"Have the dispatching skill pass the resolved qualifier invocation (wrapper path or exec form) into the verifier brief, or add an explicit resolution step to verifier-prompt.md itself.","summary":"verifier-prompt.md assumes bare `qualifier` is on PATH, which this plugin never guarantees","tags":["review","review:claude-plugin-pr14","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/reviewer-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:17:14.839636Z","id":"2b1ccade334387a4614c668f6f827ec696286cdbd27a3a01a87415c23f48c742","body":{"detail":"reviewer-prompt.md:19-20 and :28 run bare 'qualifier record --stdin ...' and 'qualifier threads <path>'. The only instruction to use '\"$WRAPPER\" exec' is in the SessionStart additionalContext (plugins/claude-code/hooks/session-start:99). The hooks reference (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks.md) says SessionStart does not fire for subagents, which get SubagentStart instead, and the plugin registers no SubagentStart hook (plugins/claude-code/hooks/hooks.json has only SessionStart). The plugin has no bin/ directory (plugins/claude-code contains only .claude-plugin, evals, hooks, scripts, skills, README.md). The plugins reference (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/plugins-reference.md, Standard layout) says only files in bin/ are put on the Bash tool's PATH. It also says ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} is 'not present in the environment of commands Claude runs through the Bash tool, in the main session or in a subagent'. reviewing-into-qualifier/SKILL.md:15-17 says only to fill in the scope, and never says to pass the wrapper. With no qualifier on PATH, the subagent's commands fail with command-not-found.","kind":"comment","references":"6f6769c295428e20f574f5bfa38b66816c0efb2f84847187b9e99311800af222","summary":"confirmed: the reviewer brief uses a bare `qualifier`, and subagents never get the wrapper instruction","tags":["verified","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/verifier-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:17:14.839794Z","id":"bc60e087950d4f07363cbcc54b595c42f7f4dab4563b3cb6124f2447ab272195","body":{"detail":"verifier-prompt.md:4 runs 'qualifier threads <id> --format json' and :14-15 run 'qualifier record --stdin ...', all bare. reviewing-into-qualifier/SKILL.md:28-30 requires a fresh verifier subagent for every review. The wrapper instruction exists only in SessionStart context (plugins/claude-code/hooks/session-start:99), which subagents never receive: per https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks.md, SessionStart does not fire for subagents, and hooks.json registers no SubagentStart. The plugin has no bin/ directory, so nothing puts qualifier on PATH (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/plugins-reference.md, Standard layout: only bin/ is added to the Bash tool's PATH). The mandatory verify step of every review fails unless the user happens to have qualifier installed separately.","kind":"comment","references":"2b7dd12789dadd56d0d791cf0f6d75ad62126aa2f9c53a2eb80a17dd7d7facce","summary":"confirmed: the verifier brief uses a bare `qualifier`, and every review must dispatch it","tags":["verified","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/reviewer-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T17:00:14.407927Z","id":"9499976579b5bd882de599a66d6a1eae6067e7ab9f2215a5aae41221b208c156","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:9b8a0136a86980787495f1656d66840fb2d6afe6","summary":"reviewer-prompt.md now invokes {QUALIFIER} (lines 20, 21, 33), not bare qualifier, and the examples run against the real binary: scripts/test-plugin.sh ok: no bare qualifier invocations in *-prompt.md files; ok: skill and brief examples run cleanly against the real qualifier","supersedes":"6f6769c295428e20f574f5bfa38b66816c0efb2f84847187b9e99311800af222","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/skills/reviewing-into-qualifier/verifier-prompt.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T17:00:14.408107Z","id":"ba1201bc1183d89b28e67a91e976f4da17459b312b3b1ed589b2bda9a787e993","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:9b8a0136a86980787495f1656d66840fb2d6afe6","summary":"verifier-prompt.md now invokes {QUALIFIER} (lines 4, 23, 24), not bare qualifier, and the examples run against the real binary: scripts/test-plugin.sh ok: no bare qualifier invocations in *-prompt.md files; ok: skill and brief examples run cleanly against the real qualifier","supersedes":"2b7dd12789dadd56d0d791cf0f6d75ad62126aa2f9c53a2eb80a17dd7d7facce","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6982e520-2dd9-4d9d-b484-c954e628c65c"]}}
